From 8a500661abbe234a0b0d1016aee571cf07ef2bb1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gustavo Noronha Silva <gustavo@noronha.dev.br>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 07:55:52 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] zink: keep the renderpass atom dirty while the renderpass
 starts

zink_draw_atoms() clears each atom's bit before it runs the atom, so
ZINK_ATOM_RENDERPASS is clean while zink_batch_rp() runs. Starting a
renderpass can draw: an emulated multisampled-render-to-texture
attachment is populated by a u_blitter replicate blit from
begin_rendering(). That nested draw is outside any renderpass and sees
the atom clean, so it does not start one of its own. Debug builds abort
on the validate_atoms() assertion that pairs the two; release builds
record the replicate draw outside a renderpass.

Mark the atom dirty for the duration of zink_batch_rp(), and afterwards
leave it dirty only if the renderpass layout changed again during the
call. A dead swapchain keeps it dirty as before.

Fixes: 769b356b5b6 ("zink: emit the draw synchronization and the renderpass as atoms")
Assisted-by: Claude Code
Signed-off-by: Gustavo Noronha Silva <gustavo@noronha.dev.br>
---
 src/gallium/drivers/zink/zink_draw.cpp | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/zink/zink_draw.cpp b/src/gallium/drivers/zink/zink_draw.cpp
index 29be4a5d723..c2b733c4774 100644
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/zink/zink_draw.cpp
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/zink/zink_draw.cpp
@@ -901,14 +901,18 @@ zink_draw_atoms(struct zink_context *ctx,
             }
             break;
          case ZINK_ATOM_RENDERPASS:
+            /* starting the renderpass can draw (attachment shadows), and that draw has to start
+             * a renderpass of its own: keep the atom dirty until this one has started
+             */
+            zink_mark_atom_dirty(ctx, ZINK_ATOM_RENDERPASS);
             zink_batch_rp(ctx);
             /* check dead swapchain */
             if (unlikely(!ctx->in_rp)) {
-               zink_mark_atom_dirty(ctx, ZINK_ATOM_RENDERPASS);
                if (VBS == ZINK_VBS_UNOWNED)
                   zink_mark_atom_dirty(ctx, ZINK_ATOM_VERTEX_BUFFERS);
                return;
             }
+            zink_set_atom_dirty(ctx, ZINK_ATOM_RENDERPASS, ctx->rp_layout_changed);
             if (BATCH_CHANGED) {
                zink_update_descriptor_refs(ctx, false);
                /* starting the renderpass can draw, and that draw has emitted its own state */
